        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Each school year all teachers shall be provided with copies of the forms and procedures to be used in their observation and assessment within their first ten (10) duty days. These forms and procedures will be formally reviewed with all teachers within their first ten (10) duty days. Prior to the formal observation each teacher will be advised as to who will observe his classroom performance. No formal observation or assessment will take place until the above provisions have been fulfilled.",
            "block_bbox": [
                55,
                183,
                488,
                327
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
